==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - guard:
      auth:
        cookie: session
      enabled: "true"
      on_forbidden:
        default:
          status: 303
          headers:
            Location: /denied
        variants:
          - when:
              request_headers:
                HX-Request: "true"
            response:
              status: "403"
              headers:
                HX-Redirect: /denied
      on_unauthenticated:
        default:
          status: 303
          headers:
            Location: /login
        variants:
          - when:
              request_headers:
                HX-Request: "true"
            response:
              status: "401"
              headers:
                HX-Redirect: /login
      require:
        authenticated: "true"
==== explainer ====
Optional pre-render route guard. When omitted or disabled, current HYPERMEDIA behavior remains unchanged
